{
	"name": "Topple",
	"type": "feat",
	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><strong>Action</strong> - 1 Creature (10 ft.)</p><p>If the [[lookup @name lowercase]] is burrowing underneath a creature of Large size or smaller and is within 10 ft. of the surface, it can attempt to collapse the ground beneath that creature's feet.</p><p><strong>[[/save dexterity]]{Dexterity Save}</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Failure:</strong> The target has the &amp;reference[Prone apply=false] condition. The ground the [[lookup @name lowercase]] disturbed becomes &amp;reference[difficult terrain] if it wasn't already.</p></li><li><p><strong>Success:</strong> No effect.</p></li></ul><p>When the [[lookup @name lowercase]] uses Topple, it makes itself vulnerable to attacks from the surface: it benefits from &amp;reference[half cover], but can be struck as if in the 5-foot cube beneath its target.</p>",
			"chat": ""
		},
